                    },
                    "message": "This target is being removed for two reasons:\n\n1. It is non-functional because it depends on /run/openbmc/chassis@0-on, a flag file no longer created since phosphor-reset-chassis-on@{}.service was removed on meta projects.\n\n2. In our configuration, the ASIC module is defined as a chassis type but lacks its own Host instance. Consequently, triggering this service causes mapper-wait to indefinitely wait for non-existent Host 1-4 state objects on the D-Bus."
                }
            ],
